---

# Make requirements testable
Condition + observable behaviour

Map each requirement to evidence.

---

# Team learning
Rotate roles · Explain your contribution
Pair, review and communicate

Keep individual understanding visible.

---

# Tests tell the story
Expected → actual → diagnosis → change → retest

A failure can be valuable evidence.

